{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible, approach and pick it up. Otherwise, scan for the object. Finally, retrieve it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
